/*================================================================================================================//
//  Project:     Timelapse Probe — MOSFET + Web Server Diagnostic                                                 //
//  Hardware:    ESP32-S3FH4R2 SuperMini                                                                          //
//  Sensors:     BH1750FVI (lux), BMP180 (temp/pressure/altitude),                                                //
//               Capacitive Soil Moisture, Battery voltage divider                                                //
//  LED:         WS2812B NeoPixel on GPIO 2  (switched via MOSFET rail)                                           //
//  Version:     V1-1                                                                                             //
//================================================================================================================//
//  Sensors and NeoPixel switched via MOSFET, WiFi + web server start once at boot and stay up permanently.       //
//  Best-practice design choices
//    ▸ Brownout detector disabled at boot
//    ▸ Battery voltage read BEFORE MOSFET on — unloaded, clean reading
//    ▸ analogReadMilliVolts() + oversampling for battery and soil ADC
//    ▸ Sea-level pressure computed via computeSeaLevelPressure() + SITE_ALTITUDE_M
//    ▸ BMP180 station pressure exposed alongside SLP in JSON and dashboard
//    ▸ BMP180 validity range matches master (50000–115000 Pa)
//    ▸ Soil ADC with SOIL_ADC_DRY / SOIL_ADC_WET calibration + SOIL_SAMPLES oversampling
//----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------//
//  **Cycle sequence**:                                                                                           //
//    SENSOR_TEST  → read all sensors every 2 s for 30 s                                                          //
//    EXTENDED     → continue reading for another 30 s                                                            //
//    RAINBOW      → cycle NeoPixel, then transition to SLEEP                                                     //
//    SLEEP        → MOSFET OFF, sensors off for 30 s, web server stays alive                                     //

//  **Web server**
//    Port 80      always available:                                                                              //
//    GET /        HTML dashboard  (auto-refreshes 3 s)                                                           //
//    GET /data    JSON sensor snapshot                                                                           //
//    GET /status  JSON system state & phase progress                                                             //
//  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  //
//  **HARDWARE WIRING**  (S3 SuperMini — matches TimeLapse_S3)                                                    //
//  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  //
//  I2C:                                                                                          //
//    SDA → GPIO 8   (4.7 kΩ pull-up to 3V3)                                                      //
//    SCL → GPIO 9   (4.7 kΩ pull-up to 3V3)                                                      //
//    BH1750 ADDR → GND → I2C address 0x23                                                        //
//    BMP180 auto-detected    → I2C address 0x77                                                   //
//  Soil ADC:                                                                                     //
//    GPIO 1  (ADC1_CH0) — capacitive probe output (0–3.3 V)                                      //
//    Dry ≈ 3.3 V,  Wet ≈ 1.1 V  (calibrate SOIL_ADC_DRY / SOIL_ADC_WET)                         //
//  Battery ADC:                                                                                  //
//    GPIO 3  (ADC1_CH2) — mid-point of 100 kΩ + 100 kΩ divider                                   //
//    LiPo+ ── 100 kΩ ──┬── 100 kΩ ── GND      Scaling factor 0.5×                                //
//  MOSFET gate → GPIO 4   HIGH = rail ON (sensors + NeoPixel)                                    //
//  NeoPixel    → GPIO 2   WS2812B, 1 LED (on MOSFET-switched rail)                               //
//                                                                                                //
//  DEPENDENCIES (Arduino Library Manager)                                                        //
//    BH1750                 — Christopher Laws                                                   //
//    Adafruit BMP085        — Adafruit  (covers BMP180, same register set)                       //
//    Adafruit Unified Sensor — Adafruit                                                          //
//    Adafruit NeoPixel      — Adafruit                                                           //
//    ESPAsyncWebServer      — me-no-dev  (or mathieucarbou fork)                                 //
//    AsyncTCP               — me-no-dev                                                          //
//================================================================================================*/

